# Verification Plan: Animation Toggle

1. [ ] Navigate to `http://localhost:3000/settings`.
2. [ ] Go to the "Appearance" tab.
3. [ ] Verify "Enable Animations" toggle is present and set to "On".
4. [ ] Navigate to `http://localhost:3000/` and observe dashboard loading animation (slide-in, no fade).
5. [ ] Return to `http://localhost:3000/settings` and turn "Enable Animations" OFF.
6. [ ] Navigate to `http://localhost:3000/` and observe if animations are gone.
7. [ ] Report findings.